id: SAFE20-1
package: fandhe-workshop-core
test: load_order
target: crates/core/src/load_gate.rs
find:     check_json_depth(bytes).map_err(LoadError::Limit)?;
replace:     let _ = check_json_depth(bytes);
expect-fail: depth_is_decided_before_parse
expect-fail: deep_valid_json_is_too_deep
expect-fail: depth_check_precedes_serde_recursion_limit
expect-fail: rejecting_stage_is_the_first_violated_in_contract_order
note: 入れ子の深さの段を外す（解釈の前に深さで断らない）
